type: software
abstract: "Research code and reproducibility artifacts for Indonesian cyberbullying detection: a standalone comment benchmark and a source-group-aware multimodal (text, visual, acoustic) video-window evaluation using frozen label release v1.1-GoldAdjudicated, additive V4 sensitivity analyses, Supplementary S7 reliability intervals, and manuscript table/figure builders."
